the story of Bigg Boss is one of  downfall born in 1935 in joining the US  military as a teenager he became the  apprentice to a legendary soldier known  as the boss  the young soldier known as John at the  time mastered combat and espionage  techniques under the boss's training  until 1959 when both were duty-bound to  go their separate ways  at some point between 1962 and 1964 John  was asked to join Fox a secret CIA unit  specifically designed to handle  top-secret infiltration missions his new  code name was Naked Snake but his first  major assignment known as the virtuous  mission was a failure tasked with  retrieving a Soviet scientist called  Nikolai Sokolov from Russia naked snakes  mission was thwarted by his old mentor  the boss who appeared to have defected  to the USSR snake was nearly killed the  boss captured Sokolov and a nuclear  missile had been detonated turning this  covert operation into headline news  placed in intensive care  Naked Snake was interrogated by the US  military and given an ultimatum he would  be pardoned but only if he returns to  Russia eliminates the boss and recovers  Sokolov the mission quickly went awry  Sokolov was killed snake was tortured  with one of his eyes shot out and an  experimental mobile nuclear missile  launcher known as the shagger hood was  captured by the boss's Cobra unit to  sling surprise the boss helps him escape  from the torture chamber he returns to  destroy the shagger hood leaving with  him one final mission to eliminate the  boss this is the first major turning  point the snake he manages to kill the  boss against his wishes and only for  duty to his country in his final moments  with his mentor he discovers that the  virtuous mission was a ruse and that the  boss's supposed defection was part of a  bigger plan concocted by a secret  organization within the White House  known as the Philosopher's  he is given the Distinguished Service  Cross and the new codename Big Boss but  he becomes a loner blaming himself for  putting his country before anything else  and retires from Fox five years later he  joins a secret multinational  organization known as the Patriots this  was a reformed version of the  philosophers but under new leadership  they are effectively an Illuminati group  but the Patriots betray Big Boss  extracting his genes to create  genetically enhanced soldiers his DNA is  also used to create three suns co named  liquid snake solid snake and solid snake  big boss leaves the Patriots and creates  his own private mercenary group known as  militare Sam fontelle using his  legendary reputation to amass an army  unaligned to any country then in 1974  big boss's mercenary army entered Costa  Rica to destroy what appeared to be the  next evolution of the shagger Hut design  known as a metal gear he also expands  his own army which is now located on an  offshore plant called mother base and  meets two characters for the first time  Chico and Paz one year later  Big Boss discovers that both Chico and  pairs have been captured and taken to  Camp Omega a maximum-security military  prison located on the southern tip of  Cuba Big Boss successfully retrieves the  tube but when returning to mother base  he finds that the base is under attack  by a mysterious military unit known as  zom the majority of his army is killed a  mother base is destroyed escaping in a  helicopter  Big Boss discovers that Paz is carrying  a bomb inside her which detonates and  downs the aircraft seemingly killing  everyone inside including Big Boss after  the events of the phantom pain big  boss's downfall is complete he creates a  military fortress in South Africa which  he calls outer heaven in 1995 he takes a  Russian scientist prisoner  and forces him to build a new metal gear  doing so would give Big Boss global  military influence but then one of his  three genetically engineered sons Solid  Snake manages to infiltrate outer heaven  destroys metal gear and blows up the  base  Big Boss only just survives and  continues with this plan two years later  in 1997 he takes control of Zanzibar a  small country in East Africa where he  attempts to build another metal gear but  the plan is once again stopped by Solid  Snake who this time confronts Big Boss  in an underground base burns him alive  and leaves him for dead  Big Boss his story after this becomes  more tragic his body is found by the  Patriots kept alive but induced into a  coma and once again his DNA is  researched and used to manufacture  next-generation military units in Metal  Gear Solid 4 which is chronologically  the final game in the series big boss is  awakened from his coma his legend ends  at the gravestone of his former mentor  the boss where he needs Solid Snake for  the final time and shares one peaceful  cigarette with his son before passing  away  you
 

